/T (SISTec Department of Mechanical Engineering has successfully enrolled the Standard Club from the Bureau of Indian Standards \(BIS\) and SISTec Gandhi Nagar is the only private Engineering Institute in Bhopal that holds the Standard Club. This club has 21 students and a mentor Dr. Ravishankar V. Choudri \(Professor & HOD\). The organization comes under the Ministry of Consumer Affairs, Food and Public Distribution, Govt. of India, BIS is the National Standard Body of India established under the BIS Act 2016 for the harmonious development of the activities of standardization, marking, and quality certification of goods. )
