/T (SISTec in collaboration with Institutions Innovation Council IIC-SISTec organized an Expert Session on the topic Achieving Problem- Solution Fit & Product- Market Fit. The expert speaker for the session was \(Professor, Dept. of MBA\) Dr. Neha Jain. During the session, Dr. Neha Jain discussed the significance of the startup journey and product development lifecycle, transitioning from initial validation to scalable growth. She also discussed the strategies for maintaining agility and adaptability in a rapidly evolving market.)
/E (SISTec in collaboration with Institutions Innovation Council IIC-SISTec organized an Expert Session on the topic Achieving Problem- Solution Fit & Product- Market Fit. The expert speaker for the session was \(Professor, Dept. of MBA\) Dr. Neha Jain. During the session, Dr. Neha Jain discussed the significance of the startup journey and product development lifecycle, transitioning from initial validation to scalable growth. She also discussed the strategies for maintaining agility and adaptability in a rapidly evolving market.)
/Pg 13 0 R
