/T (Google Developers Student Club under the SISTec Department of Computer Science & Engineering organized an event "Google Cloud Study Jam" where participants were offered an immersive 30-day exploration of Google Cloud Platform \(GCP\), the powerful suite of cloud computing services from Google. Through a combination of self-paced learning modules, engaging hands-on labs, and collaborative discussions, the participants delved into the fundamentals of cloud infrastructure, data management, and application development, and were equipped with Qwiklabs, a platform providing free access to GCP environments.)
